          "insert": "structure.title-heading detects only an opening H1 that repeats the display title. Every document save removes that duplicate before linting and persistence, preserving its children. Distinct opening H1s and later H1s remain unchanged; heading levels are never demoted by cleanup. The edit and correction share one undo patch, and the response returns the final document and revision. Ordinary edits need no repair-tool call."
